_id=<?= (int) $profile['id'] ?>">Continue Kundli setup</a><?php endif; ?></div><?php else: ?><p class="muted">Your Kundli has not been generated yet. Add your birth details to continue.</p><?php endif; ?></section></section></main></body></html>
